# Words sent in the made-up chat; the agent works, answers, its turn ends: its activity stays a moment, then leaves
# the list (docs/list-motion.md), the rows over it coming down as its room closes.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 看一下列表的高度
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 9000
